runExternalM2ReturnAnswer -- stores a Macaulay2 variable's value in a file, to later be read by the RunExternalM2 package
*************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        runExternalM2ReturnAnswer(f,t)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, the filename
      * t, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, the variable to store

Description
===========

This function tries to serialize t into the file f, that is, convert it into a
standard format for storage. In this case, we convert t into a string using
*note toExternalString: (Macaulay2Doc)toExternalString,. This function is not
intended for public use.

